# Start an analysis sequence by id. The set of sequences is defined in
# astrotech_rover's drivers/analysis_protocol.py (seeded from the lead's
# AnalysisFiles/ protocol). Rejected (success=false) if a sequence is already
# running or the hardware bus isn't up.
#
# Foxglove panels have no ROS action client, so the analysis panel drives the
# sequencer through this service + a std_srvs/Trigger cancel + an
# AnalysisStatus topic (the "Option B" Foxglove-native interface).
int8 sequence_id
---
bool success
string message
